  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now all of your Synced and Local Expression Parameters are mixed together in one list which can be quite unorganized and makes it harder to keep track of them. Especially sincere there is no limit to Local parameters.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nSplit Synced and Local Expression Parameters into two different Lists, they should still all be in one Expression Parameters file though. That way it's easier to keep track of your Synced and Local Parameters, which is especially useful if you have a lot of parameters or want manage your synced data usage a bit.",
